{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1000_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "5958be575b794aaee42c9c335c88ffdd2da6f52cf35bc5b8d7e7d3eaa07f3d6f", "ja": "……以上、先日のやよいちゃんの、\nステージ映像をお送りいたしました！", "zh": "……以上，就是前几天弥生，\n在舞台上的演出了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "df7614ceaf9423d0fefcffcf379a5d18764439b52ad9b9421435bb246cc70b82", "ja": "ありがとうございましたー！", "zh": "谢谢大家──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1002_influencer", "source_sha256": "2833d799d645f44cc8ea2999f6de9d16a5658bb9abeaef56fabd3f9e52081ce8", "ja": "アイドル、ヤバッ！　ホントにやよいちゃんなの！？\nめちゃカワだったよ～！", "zh": "偶像，太厉害了！真的是弥生吗！？\n超级可爱～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1003_purokisi", "source_sha256": "dd9c26eb86c148412cab732f56d315fbd354f2edc114a9537b9f1ec88dda0b8c", "ja": "すごかったです……。ステージの上で、歌って踊って\nるのに、あんなに元気で、笑顔で……圧倒されました。", "zh": "太厉害了……明明在舞台上又唱又跳，却还能那么有活力、满脸笑容……真的让人折服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "9c2aaf6799b2d5a95088a459d2fedd95c919a4364a2c483da414adcd319c098b", "ja": "楽しいから、ずーっと笑顔になれるんだよ！\nファンの人たちも、すっごくニコニコしてくれるし！", "zh": "因为很开心，所以才能一直笑嘛！\n粉丝们也都笑得超级灿烂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "2084e2582522b999fc4614e1b1cdb4ac679a8d0d6fc798541dcd91e5915ec3f1", "ja": "みんなの楽しそうな顔を見ると、\n私も、元気になるんだー。", "zh": "看到大家开心的表情，\n我也变得精神满满啦——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "17c5cf764494030c9f53e8165dd694b6ddcaaabe2e378d46d2ab52dd11a97f89", "ja": "だから私の夢は、もっともっとたくさんの人に、\nステージを見てもらうことです！", "zh": "所以我的梦想就是，让更多更多的人来看我们的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1007_moderu", "source_sha256": "2dcdb770ff881b9c39a8159ed2b1b5cfa5f1219d9f4eedaf1b3bbe79007258ca", "ja": "わあ、いい夢だね！　……でもさっきの歌って、\n恋愛の曲だよね。やよいちゃん、恋愛経験あるの？", "zh": "哇，真是个美梦呢！……不过刚才那首歌，\n是关于恋爱的曲子吧。弥生，你有谈过恋爱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1008_progamer", "source_sha256": "81bcc184dcf5b0b1f5ceb952add019975b453c9180584a330d455c04c69ef4a4", "ja": "えー？\nアイドルって、恋愛禁止なんじゃないの？", "zh": "诶——？\n偶像不是禁止谈恋爱的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1009_nethaisinnsya", "source_sha256": "15c1ff63127f7a859fadce1b6c3521f94f8c3784c9e648a93200c9d6d42404db", "ja": "でも、恋愛もののドラマとか出たりするし。\n全然経験ないのも、困るんじゃない？", "zh": "不过，毕竟也会出演恋爱题材的电视剧之类的。\n完全没有经验的话，不也会很为难吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "0fb25e720d0031a107de99fc53b6236c77b25bd9978a4ea1d7a839639c0e28ab", "ja": "えっ。え、えっと、えっとー……。", "zh": "欸？呃、那个、那个——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1012_p", "source_sha256": "28cf74ac3b4c19ab10ee1f0e9ef241c4333c3e1673d7dca79162e83a6a6c6e8e", "ja": "やよい、お疲れさま！\n今日の収録は、だいぶ盛り上がったな。", "zh": "弥生，辛苦了！\n今天的录音现场真是热闹非凡啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "ca6c0bc960530acffe6479eae4b87d61f24591eb8bbe6d56f3e1dc695c7177ee", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。途中から\n違う話になっちゃったけど、よかったんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。虽然中途聊成了别的话题，这样真的没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1014_p", "source_sha256": "676d152904717f34995cdf3f0f582ff7dfcd11d511186347ddd7e7692d7a1449", "ja": "気にしなくて大丈夫だよ。みんなの等身大の\n表情が撮れたって、スタッフさんも喜んでたから。", "zh": "不用在意，没关系的。工作人员也很高兴，说拍到了大家最自然的表情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1015_p", "source_sha256": "082a60ad6c29b93a6c7935ab299e4aaca3b9f4939843333dc66780a2ce4dc638", "ja": "ひょっとしたら番組のおかげで、やよいにも\n恋愛ドラマのオファーがくるかもしれないな。", "zh": "说不定托节目的福，连弥生也会收到恋爱电视剧的邀约呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "0ad98f8795233690765e7504c9d816541b96c442168edbaf5f412704dc3ee63a", "ja": "そうなんですね。でも私、\n恋愛ドラマはあんまり興味ないかも……。", "zh": "原来是这样。不过我对恋爱电视剧可能不太感兴趣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1017_p", "source_sha256": "cd4d3be5633fa4e59cd67cc1fa886fc78504b53e748ecf6144507eeb1473e866", "ja": "あれ、そうなのか。\nやよいは、恋愛にはあまり興味がないのか……。", "zh": "哎，是这样吗？\n原来弥生对谈恋爱不太感兴趣啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "fe4460b993f346ee9b2a4f15be3b97859c7b185869af5a839dda74158d8ecc1f", "ja": "あ、えっと。ドラマには興味ないですけど、\n恋愛には興味があります！", "zh": "啊，那个……我对电视剧没什么兴趣，\n不过我对恋爱很感兴趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1019_p", "source_sha256": "14d7405d66ef82fcb84fcecdccda0335afe97eb9f997f28b60177e8a9506d925", "ja": "えっ。……そ、そうなのか？", "zh": "咦……是、是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "b9a5022863e4af23ba5a1231570135033576e159ccb60150ea2c2075473cfd35", "ja": "はい！　うちのお父さんとお母さんは\n仲がいいんですけど、そういうの、素敵だなーって。", "zh": "是的！我爸爸和妈妈感情很好，我觉得那样真好呀——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "bfa023ea8673ad329f62cca13e6f2b61e19ef6cbe0ece88d5508b9f7dbf522c5", "ja": "だから私も、いつかそんなふうに、\n自分の家族ができたらなーって！", "zh": "所以我也想着，什么时候能像那样拥有自己的家庭就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_096_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_096_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e17f9f2c25ad861f9d1e5da58248b371f8834538fea0112f356eaecd744778e6", "ja": "そ、そうか……うん、そうだな。\nまだ少し早いけど、いつかできるといいな……！", "zh": "这、这样啊……嗯，是啊。\n虽然现在还稍微早了点，但希望总有一天能实现……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
